WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
China is an East Asian nation with over five millennia of continuous recorded civilization.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The Great Wall winds over 21,000 kilometers across northern ridges, deserts, and mountain passes.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Standard Mandarin Chinese is the official national language written with time-honored characters.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Traditional attire features the elegant Hanfu and silk Qipao woven with natural mulberry fibers.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Traditional music features the 21-string Guzheng zither and the expressive Erhu two-string fiddle.

